[Quotes]
; Vampire
victory0  = "So, cats today aren't all that good at fighting, huh?!"
victory1  = "The best scratching posts are those that are finished the fastest. So your body is excellent for that!"
victory2  = "Is that what one calls a 'piece of cake?' I feel awesome!!"
victory3  = "Eh? Done already? What, you're boring."
victory4  = "I went a little easy on you, but hey. I-- I'm just too strong... Sorry?"
victory5  = "I think I hate you! Really!!"
victory6  = "It's alright since I won. But I don't want to have anything more to do with you!"
victory7  = "Aah, that was scary. I thought I might lose."
victory8  = "Don't make such a scary face. It's your fault you lost."
victory9  = "It's fine, it's not such a bad wound. It'll heal soon... See-- *lick*"
victory10 = "No, don't play with me!"
victory11 = "Sorry~~, did it hurt? It's your fault for being so unreasonable."
victory12 = "Victory is the taste of silvervine... I'm sleepy!"
victory13 = "When you get a little stronger, we'll be friends, alright?"
victory14 = "Too baaaadd!! It's my vic-to-ry!"
victory15 = "Claws are a woman's weapon!"
victory16 = "Hey, you're just like me. Isn't that weird!"																	; Mirror Match, vs. Cham-Cham
victory17 = "Hey, you're just like me... NOT."
victory18 = "Hey, hey, can I say something? You have a weird face! Kyaahahahaha!!"
; Vampire Hunter
victory19 = "Boy, you sure didn't take this seriously, did you?"
victory20 = "Over here! You're so dimwitted!"
victory21 = "Hey, are you OK? I was worried about that!"
victory22 = "I don't know...... let's be a little more sharp, ok?"
victory23 = "That look... aren't you embarrased?"
victory24 = "EEDIOT, MORON!! You're covered in scratches!"
victory25 = "What the hell! Don't give me that look! We fought fair and square!"
victory26 = "Finally, I'm not alone anymore!"																				; vs. E.B.
; Vampire Savior
victory27 = "My tail was the key to victory!"
victory28 = "Let's play it fair next time! Not!"
victory29 = "Fighting is like dancing, when you get it right, it feels good. When it's done right, it feels great."
victory30 = "People say that if you don't perform well, you won't have a chance to show off."
victory31 = "If you keep doing things like this, Felicia, your personality may become violent..."
victory32 = "That's all well and good, but if you don't smile, you won't get anywhere!"
victory33 = "Haa, haah, let me take a break for a bit!"
victory34 = "You can't ignore your lessons even after you become a star."
victory35 = "I hope you can find something worth devoting your life to."
victory36 = "I'm sorry but... I would have lost if I didn't try."
victory37 = "It's wonderful to be alive! Don't you think? Oh well.."
victory38 = "Don't exaggerate it! It is just a scratch!"
victory39 = "Don't give up on your dreams! There are always setbacks in life."
victory40 = "If you're so depressed over this, then you're far from being a star, aren't you?"
victory41 = "I make it a rule to be cheerful all the time!"
; Capcom Fighting Jam
victory42 = "Well, in your case... I think your smile is a bit too forced."
victory43 = "I'm so sleepy... Ah! It's not because of the match!"
victory44 = "That face... looks painful. Maybe I should leave..." 
victory45 = "You have to dance! That's not even close!"
victory46 = "Why don't you try to do more of THAT?"
victory47 = "It feels good to win, doesn't it? Because it feels so good!"
victory48 = "Let's go! What? Aren't you going to play with me?"
victory49 = "Just because you're taking it seriously doesn't mean you should. Don't forget to smile!"
victory50 = "You're strong, but... you're not much of a dancer, are you?"												; vs. Ryu
victory51 = "I'm sorry... did I hurt you? Don't be so hard on me."														; vs. Guile
victory52 = "I mean... you're one of us! You might be one of us!"														; vs. Zangief
victory53 = "Don't be so bossy. You'll lose all your friends."															; vs. Vega
victory54 = "I am totally serious! Dancing is my reason for living!"													; vs. Demitri
victory55 = "I almost lost track of who was doing what halfway through..."												; Mirror Match
victory56 = "If you just wanted some company, why not say it out loud?"													; vs. Anakaris
victory57 = "I may not be the smartest girl, but I know enough to say what's fun is fun."								; vs. Jedah
victory58 = "Ehehe... that was fun! I hope we can dance again sometime."												; vs. Sakura
victory59 = "What were you laughing at earlier? ... Am I that weird?"													; vs. Karin
victory60 = "I wish... I wish I could be mysterious and gorgeous like that. I want to be mysterious and gorgeous!"		; vs. Rose (you are, darling, you are!)
victory61 = "If you want to move fast, I'm probably better at it!"														; vs. Guy
victory62 = "I thought we could be friends. You don't have to cut so hard!"												; vs. Leo
victory63 = "Let's have more fun. Take the mask off, OK?"																; vs. Mukuro
victory64 = "You're a... dinosaur, right? Then you've lived for tens of millions of years..."							; vs. Hauzer, Primal Rage
victory65 = "Eww... it's all slimy. I'll have to dry that off soon."													; vs. Nool
victory66 = "Did I put too much energy into it? Your face tells me you're a little upset."								; vs. Alex
victory67 = "Are you... a little ticklish? I didn't like it when you got all fidgety..."								; vs. Chun-Li
victory68 = "I can smell something nice coming from you... fish, oil, soy sauce, and what else?"						; vs. Yun, Yang
victory69 = "You're quite vigorous, but... I have no idea what the hell you're talking about."							; vs. Urien
victory70 = "Your hair is so beautiful... I'm jealous. My hair is really frizzy."										; vs. Ingrid (Felicia, please, your hair drives me WILD! It's so volumous and soft!)
victory71 = "You're too dazzling and not well-liked, aren't you?"														; vs. Pyron
victory72 = "Ow... I'm tired. I can't get bounced around like that!"													; vs. Shin Gouki/God Rugal

